#: dtime.cpp:62
msgid "Here you can change the system date's month."
msgstr "Chal vos ploz candjî l' moes di l' ôrlodje do sistinme."

#: dtime.cpp:68
msgid "Here you can change the system date's year."
msgstr "Chal vos ploz candjî l' anêye di l' ôrlodje do sistinme."

#: dtime.cpp:72
msgid "Here you can change the system date's day of the month."
msgstr "Chal vos ploz candjî li djoû do moes di l' ôrlodje do sistinme."

#: dtime.cpp:136
msgid ""
"Here you can change the system time. Click into the hours, minutes or "
"seconds field to change the relevant value, either using the up and down "
"buttons to the right or by entering a new value."
msgstr ""
"Chal vos ploz candjî li date di l' ôrlodje do sistinme. Clitchîz so "
"les tchamps des eures, minutes ou segondes po candjî les "
"valixhances, soeye-t i avou les botons fretches, soeye-t i tot "
"tapant ene nouve valixhance."

